title: Foreign Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; foreign_policy_timer += 8; kmt_in_government = 1;
view-if: foreign_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/EugeneChen.jpg
go-to: fp_menu
#subtitle: International relations and dealing with Concessions.

= Foreign Policy

What should our foreign policy priority be?

@fp_menu

- @improve_west
- @improve_east
- @improve_soviet
- @improve_japan
- @negotiate
- @concession1
- @concession2
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@improve_west
title: Improve our relations with the Western Allies.
on-arrival: west_relation += 2;



@improve_japan
title: Improve our relations with the Empire of Japan.
on-arrival: japan_relation += 1;

Japan is still keen on supporting Zhang Zuolin and their ambitions in Manchuria slow down our relation-building.

@improve_soviet
title: Improve our relations with the Soviet Union.
subtitle: We could also broach the question of arms...

The Soviet Union has been supporting our movement since 1924, and it is necessary to continue good relations to advance our war.

- @soviet_military_aid: Buy more arms and guns from the Red Army.
- @soviet_improve_relations: Keep building ties with the Soviets.
- @soviet_improve_no: We choose not to cooperate with the Russians for now.

@soviet_military_aid
choose-if: budget >= 1 and cpc_civil_war = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The Soviets distrust us after Chiang's massacre.
subtitle: -1 budget
on-arrival: budget -= 1; soviet_relation += 1; nra_militancy += 0.1;

The Soviets have agreed to help train and supply our military. The NRA appreciates our support.

@soviet_improve_relations
choose-if: cpc_civil_war = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The Soviets distrust us after Chiang's massacre.
on-arrival: soviet_relation += 2;

Stalin has agreed to reaffirm our alliance and cooperation against the Japanese lackeys in Manchuria.

- @cpc: Ask if Moscow could help repair our relations with the CPC.
- @root: Do not mention the KPD.

@soviet_improve_no

We decide to leave the Soviets alone.

@cpc
on-arrival: cpc_relation += 8*(1-dissent);

We also mention the CPC in our conversations with the Soviet ambassador. The Soviets have put in a good word for us with the Communists.

@negotiate
title: Negotiate regarding our Concession ports.
subtitle: This will be a hard affair. [? if concessions = 1: After successfully negotiating for the return of many British settlements, it may become harder to negotiate with them. ?]
on-arrival: west_relation += 1; concessions_negotiation += 1; concessions_negotiation += 1 if west_relation >= 3; concessions_negotiation += 0.5 if concessions = 1;

After defeating the Zhili, the English and Americans now look at us more favourably. 

@concession1
title: The Western Allies are finally willing to return some concessions!
subtitle: -1 budget - Our negotiations have been successful.
view-if: concessions_negotiation >= 3 and concessions = 0
on-arrival: west_relation += 1; concessions += 1; budget -= 2; workers_kmt += 6*(1-dissent); old_middle_kmt += 6*(1-dissent); new_middle_kmt += 6*(1-dissent); rural_kmt += 6*(1-dissent); economic_growth += 0.7; economic_growth += 0.5 if economic_growth < 0
max-visits: 1

Finally, after a lot of rounds of negotiations, we can buy out the ports of Hankou, Jiujiang and Zhenjiang from the British. This is a great achievement both in foreign affairs and for our support bases, where anti-imperialists now begin supporting us.

@concession2
title: The Western Allies are finally willing to return some concessions!
subtitle: -3 budget - Our negotiations have been successful.
view-if: concessions_negotiation >= 3 and concessions = 1
on-arrival: west_relation += 1; budget -= 3; workers_kmt += 10*(1-dissent); old_middle_kmt += 8*(1-dissent); new_middle_kmt += 8*(1-dissent); rural_kmt += 12*(1-dissent); economic_growth += 0.7; economic_growth += 0.5 if economic_growth < 0
max-visits: 1

After many more rounds of negotiation, we can now buy out Weihaiwei and Tianjin from the British, further increasing our support in the masses. 
